    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, throw, and survive in this chaotic 2-4 player physics-based party game! As your preferred critter caught in a sudden flood, you must fight in a massive trash pile to claim your crown as the true &quot;Royal Vermin.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use whatever garbage you can grab to sabotage your rivals. Throw trash to knock opponents off balance, discover unique projectiles with special properties, and do the party in the junkyard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAOTIC MULTIPLAYER:</strong> Local competitive gameplay for 2-4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS-BASED MADNESS:</strong> Every piece of trash follows super hyper mega realistic physics for unpredictable and hilarious results</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACING:</strong> Go fast and win</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE PROJECTILES:</strong> Master different trash items with special properties</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ENVIRONMENTS:</strong> Navigate shifting trash piles and environmental hazards that change every match</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION:</strong> Unlock and customize your vermin with skins and HATS</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ARENAS:</strong> Battle across different trash-filled environments, each with unique challenges</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACCESSIBLE FUN:</strong> Easy to learn, difficult to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you claim the crown or drown in defeat? Gather your friends and find out who's the true Royal Vermin!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, throw, and survive in this chaotic 2-4 player physics-based party game! As your preferred critter caught in a sudden flood, you must fight in a massive trash pile to claim your crown as the true &quot;Royal Vermin.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use whatever garbage you can grab to sabotage your rivals. Throw trash to knock opponents off balance, discover unique projectiles with special properties, and do the party in the junkyard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAOTIC MULTIPLAYER:</strong> Local competitive gameplay for 2-4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS-BASED MADNESS:</strong> Every piece of trash follows super hyper mega realistic physics for unpredictable and hilarious results</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACING:</strong> Go fast and win</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE PROJECTILES:</strong> Master different trash items with special properties</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ENVIRONMENTS:</strong> Navigate shifting trash piles and environmental hazards that change every match</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION:</strong> Unlock and customize your vermin with skins and HATS</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ARENAS:</strong> Battle across different trash-filled environments, each with unique challenges</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACCESSIBLE FUN:</strong> Easy to learn, difficult to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you claim the crown or drown in defeat? Gather your friends and find out who's the true Royal Vermin!</p>",
